OL,3,GNEWSAAdlington makes school swimming
OL,4,Aoffer to councils
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlympic gold medalist Becky Adlington
OL,7,Fsays she wants to work with councils to
OL,8,Fget more children swimming.
OL,10,FShe decided to offer free lessons this
OL,11,Fsummer through her Swim! swimming
OL,12,Fschool after reading a BBC report on
OL,13,Fthe number of children unable to swim
OL,14,F25m.
OL,16,FAdlington said the issue of pool
OL,17,Fclosures had "been really bad for a
OL,18,Freally long time" but there were lots
OL,19,Fof issues involved, so it was a
OL,20,Fdifficult problem to solve.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
